SOURCE -> OUTBOX : the domain event you 've fixed
OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : The unchanging event
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable delivery_snapshot_event\n(outbox_event_uuid, exact scope)\nunique derivation; without coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : exact scope lease + fencing
WORKER -> SOURCE : Read the last one . exact-scope The condition
group One . DB transaction
  WORKER -> PROJECTION : I 'm going to take a sanitised image .
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready event, If it 's declared contract kind
end
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : recording is stable
DISPATCHER -> Client : Send / repeat / play

note over SOURCE,PROJECTION
  Provider JSON It only reveals provider/delivery.
  For the draft/push without public event task It 's fixed . effect guard
  And it ends without event row.
  Raw protocol metadata and account data remain hidden.
